WEBVTT

00:01.641 --> 00:02.978
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.002 --> 00:04.337
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.361 --> 00:07.577
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.601 --> 00:13.161
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.161 --> 01:31.121
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.281 --> 01:34.521
=Episode 37=

01:44.360 --> 01:45.360
Back off!

01:56.280 --> 01:57.521
You scared me.

01:57.840 --> 01:58.697
In your condition,

01:58.721 --> 01:59.872
even you are an immortal,

01:59.896 --> 02:01.096
you can't kill anyone.

02:06.321 --> 02:07.597
I'm not going to kill you,

02:07.621 --> 02:09.221
but to damage your luck.

02:09.571 --> 02:10.896
Xu Fengnian.

02:11.171 --> 02:12.497
You didn't acquire Dahuangting

02:12.521 --> 02:14.421
through your own effort.

02:14.721 --> 02:16.377
I'm passing my own luck

02:16.401 --> 02:17.447
and my martial arts

02:17.471 --> 02:18.671
to you,

02:19.146 --> 02:20.897
and also passing

02:20.921 --> 02:22.096
my ordeals to you.

02:22.646 --> 02:24.536
Nothing would happen to you

02:24.560 --> 02:26.397
if you had been practicing martial arts
since childhood.

02:26.421 --> 02:28.021
But now,

02:28.746 --> 02:30.921
your internal force
will be out of whack.

02:31.271 --> 02:33.121
No one can save you.

02:37.071 --> 02:39.196
Even if my soul is going to perish,

02:39.871 --> 02:42.571
I must kill you
in front of Deng Tai'e first.

03:02.596 --> 03:04.121
The luck-changing technique?

03:05.246 --> 03:07.171
You are that old man's disciple?

03:16.320 --> 03:17.321
Xu...

03:38.746 --> 03:39.880
Why did you save me?

03:44.821 --> 03:46.341
Your Highness! Your Highness!

03:47.071 --> 03:48.071
Your Highness.

03:54.096 --> 03:56.481
Because your mother gave me a chance

03:57.496 --> 04:00.021
when I was desperate.

04:03.946 --> 04:04.946
Here.

04:24.421 --> 04:25.681
I'll kill

04:27.396 --> 04:28.681
whoever tries to kill you.

04:52.371 --> 04:53.371
We'll meet again.

04:53.621 --> 04:55.440
Two coins for one word by then.

04:55.821 --> 04:56.821
All right.

04:57.471 --> 04:58.841
It's a deal.

04:59.621 --> 05:00.398
That will be

05:00.422 --> 05:01.546
a new-year gift for you.

05:02.221 --> 05:03.896
Are you a dog?

05:04.146 --> 05:05.376
The girl behind me,

05:05.400 --> 05:06.616
only I can bully her,

05:06.640 --> 05:08.221
but you can't.

05:10.371 --> 05:11.671
(Cake Pastry)

05:18.771 --> 05:20.447
I was born to owe something
to this world.

05:20.471 --> 05:21.996
I wish everything was ruined!

05:43.196 --> 05:44.196
Xu Fengnian.

05:44.871 --> 05:46.161
Even you are going to die,

05:47.146 --> 05:48.571
you must die in my hands.

06:02.196 --> 06:03.520
Trust me.

06:03.771 --> 06:05.080
I can defend the world and you.

06:25.071 --> 06:26.146
Where is that girl?

06:26.571 --> 06:27.571
She has left.

06:28.121 --> 06:29.161
She didn't say anything?

06:29.671 --> 06:30.671
No.

06:34.696 --> 06:36.396
The bitterest battle in this world

06:37.371 --> 06:38.597
is over.

06:38.621 --> 06:41.246
(Wudi City)

06:49.196 --> 06:50.621
I think I'm okay.

06:51.046 --> 06:52.126
I just feel a little dizzy.

06:53.321 --> 06:54.696
That man from Mount Longhu

06:55.021 --> 06:56.021
passed his martial arts

06:56.171 --> 06:59.197
to Your Highness before he died.

06:59.221 --> 07:00.246
He wanted

07:00.471 --> 07:02.221
to mess with your internal force

07:02.571 --> 07:03.681
and damage your luck,

07:04.221 --> 07:04.923
but

07:04.947 --> 07:06.321
Miss Hehe

07:06.471 --> 07:07.601
stopped him

07:07.721 --> 07:09.096
and took his luck for you.

07:10.346 --> 07:11.073
Your Highness,

07:11.097 --> 07:12.697
you are almost fit now.

07:12.721 --> 07:14.201
You only need to rest for a few days.

07:14.821 --> 07:16.096
What will happen to that girl?

07:16.871 --> 07:17.871
I don't know.

07:18.346 --> 07:20.621
The luck-changing technique is rare.

07:21.046 --> 07:22.246
I don't know much about it.

07:22.621 --> 07:23.473
Since she knows

07:23.497 --> 07:24.722
such a rare technique,

07:24.746 --> 07:26.106
it means someone taught it to her.

07:26.796 --> 07:28.356
Nothing serious is gonna happen to her.

07:28.946 --> 07:29.946
Senior Li.

07:30.121 --> 07:30.871
Are you finished?

07:31.121 --> 07:32.171
Yes.

07:32.921 --> 07:33.856
Did Deng Tai'e give it to you?

07:33.880 --> 07:34.446
Yes.

07:34.896 --> 07:35.896
Where is Senior Deng?

07:35.946 --> 07:36.946
He's gone.

07:38.421 --> 07:39.996
He really left it to me?

07:40.446 --> 07:42.337
He left you the flying swords
and passed you his swordplay.

07:42.361 --> 07:43.846
He's generous to you.

07:44.646 --> 07:46.017
Observe the flying swords
when you have time

07:46.041 --> 07:47.696
and think about his moves today.

07:48.646 --> 07:50.181
Didn't you ask me

07:50.205 --> 07:51.822
to go my own way

07:51.846 --> 07:53.522
and not to learn from others?

07:53.546 --> 07:54.536
With me teaching Sword Intent,

07:54.560 --> 07:56.471
there is no need to learn from others.

07:56.971 --> 07:58.337
But the flying swords of Deng Tai'e

07:58.361 --> 08:00.071
can be used for reference.

08:00.421 --> 08:02.272
It's just that the sword is too delicate

08:02.296 --> 08:03.296
in such a bright color.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.672
It's the taste of little girls

08:04.696 --> 08:05.946
under the age of eight.

08:06.841 --> 08:08.196
I'm glad Senior Deng left,

08:08.321 --> 08:09.846
or you would fight again.

08:10.046 --> 08:11.121
So what?

08:11.496 --> 08:12.817
I'm no match for Wang Xianzhi,

08:12.841 --> 08:14.246
but I can beat Deng Tai'e.

08:14.546 --> 08:15.746
Did you lose

08:16.446 --> 08:17.520
above the East Sea?

08:18.046 --> 08:19.646
The battle is still up in the air.

08:19.746 --> 08:21.506
But I think I would lose
if we keep fighting.

08:22.946 --> 08:23.946
You are not finished?

08:24.196 --> 08:25.138
We stopped.

08:25.162 --> 08:27.071
Heaven's Gate will reopen
if we keep fighting.

08:27.396 --> 08:28.697
Is there really an Immortal Realm?

08:28.721 --> 08:30.041
What's different about immortals?

08:30.446 --> 08:32.801
They're all idiots
who think they're immortals.

08:34.171 --> 08:35.971
Do you know the secrets
of the Immortal Realm?

08:36.371 --> 08:37.218
You don't need to know

08:37.242 --> 08:38.347
that kind of meaningless thing.

08:38.371 --> 08:39.457
With your ability,

08:39.481 --> 08:41.571
that place is a long way off.

08:42.646 --> 08:44.000
If you say so.

08:44.721 --> 08:45.897
But then again,

08:45.921 --> 08:47.297
if this battle wasn't finished,

08:47.321 --> 08:48.198
you didn't lose.

08:48.222 --> 08:49.272
Maybe Wang Xianzhi would be exhausted

08:49.296 --> 08:50.921
if you keep fighting.

08:51.221 --> 08:52.496
If you lose, you lose.

08:53.171 --> 08:55.177
Wang Xianzhi has a solid foundation,

08:55.201 --> 08:55.897
and he learns quickly.

08:55.921 --> 08:57.347
He's been cultivating himself steadily

08:57.371 --> 08:59.256
and he has won
almost every great martial artist

08:59.280 --> 09:00.321
to hone his skill.

09:00.721 --> 09:02.521
I wasted a few years,

09:03.221 --> 09:05.096
and I can't win with one arm.

09:10.796 --> 09:12.097
Anyway, in my heart,

09:12.121 --> 09:13.321
you are the best in the world.

09:14.896 --> 09:16.196
Who cares?

09:16.321 --> 09:17.561
Having fun is what's important.

09:17.771 --> 09:19.016
But during that battle,

09:19.040 --> 09:20.797
Wang Xianzhi used
nine-tenths of his force.

09:20.821 --> 09:22.457
I'm afraid there are only a few people

09:22.481 --> 09:23.761
who can force him to this point.

09:23.921 --> 09:25.621
He didn't do his best?

09:25.846 --> 09:27.217
If Wang Xianzhi does his best,

09:27.241 --> 09:29.217
I'm afraid only Lyuzu 500 years ago

09:29.241 --> 09:30.640
can get an edge over him!

09:31.021 --> 09:32.297
Is he that strong?

09:32.321 --> 09:33.321
Um.

09:35.171 --> 09:37.297
Are we still gonna stay in Wudi City?

09:37.321 --> 09:38.446
Of course.

09:39.171 --> 09:40.058
Let's run now!

09:40.082 --> 09:41.442
I even took Old Huang's sword box.

09:41.561 --> 09:42.338
Just take it.

09:42.362 --> 09:44.322
Wang Xianzhi will still do me
such a little favor.

09:50.071 --> 09:51.071
Well,

09:51.846 --> 09:53.841
how big a favor do you think
he can do for you?

09:56.046 --> 09:57.221
What do you want?

09:58.721 --> 10:00.646
Can I talk to Wang Xianzhi?

10:23.846 --> 10:25.846
Why do the people of Mount Longhu
want to kill you?

10:26.971 --> 10:28.760
To weed the country
of treacherous people.

10:29.621 --> 10:30.621
Who are they?

10:31.896 --> 10:32.961
Me,

10:33.546 --> 10:34.640
and Xu Fengnian.

10:35.846 --> 10:36.561
Both of us.

10:36.796 --> 10:37.796
Hold on.

10:38.021 --> 10:39.897
I can understand
that Xu Fengnian is treacherous.

10:39.921 --> 10:42.321
After all, North Liang is a big threat
for the court.

10:43.246 --> 10:44.246
What about you?

10:44.671 --> 10:46.096
Didn't you say you are a prince?

10:46.171 --> 10:47.171
It can't be helped.

10:47.646 --> 10:49.280
I'm an illegitimate son.

10:50.021 --> 10:51.661
The real reason
I want to kill Xu Fengnian

10:51.971 --> 10:54.361
is to instigate a war,

10:54.846 --> 10:56.926
so that I can take the chance
to hold military power.

10:57.021 --> 10:58.880
Now I've been seen through.

10:59.796 --> 11:00.996
It makes sense

11:02.096 --> 11:03.396
that they want to kill me.

11:05.496 --> 11:06.601
Who has seen through you?

11:07.371 --> 11:08.371
Mount Longhu?

11:08.646 --> 11:10.081
Mount Longhu is only the enforcer.

11:10.696 --> 11:11.856
The person behind this

11:11.880 --> 11:12.920
is probably Zhang Julu.

11:13.796 --> 11:15.160
That old man is shrewd.

11:15.321 --> 11:16.921
It's too hard to keep anything from him.

11:17.400 --> 11:20.880
So you know why Mount Longhu
wants to kill you?

11:21.371 --> 11:22.371
Yes.

11:23.096 --> 11:24.096
If I were them,

11:24.571 --> 11:25.771
I would do the same thing.

11:27.446 --> 11:28.680
Kill me

11:29.971 --> 11:31.601
to prevent future chaos.

11:32.196 --> 11:33.760
Since I refuse to be average,

11:34.696 --> 11:36.056
I should take all the consequences

11:36.821 --> 11:38.297
on my own.

11:38.321 --> 11:39.446
I can't blame anyone else.

11:40.646 --> 11:42.597
You even figured out who is behind this?

11:42.621 --> 11:43.621
Yeah.

11:45.896 --> 11:48.096
Then why do you still look so confused?

11:50.821 --> 11:52.571
I just can't figure out

11:53.146 --> 11:55.221
why he saved me.

11:57.046 --> 11:58.872
He recognized the Fujiang Armor

11:58.896 --> 12:00.972
and confirmed that I've been trying
to kill him along the way.

12:00.996 --> 12:03.121
We should be dead enemies now.

12:03.146 --> 12:04.400
Why did he save me?

12:08.246 --> 12:09.886
Because he wants
to make friends with you?

12:14.971 --> 12:16.976
If I've been trying
to kill you all the time,

12:17.000 --> 12:18.646
would you want to make friends with me?

12:21.821 --> 12:23.246
I can't think of anything else.

12:23.571 --> 12:24.796
I can't figure it out.

12:27.721 --> 12:28.880
Never mind, let's go.

12:31.321 --> 12:32.496
Go back to Wudi City?

12:33.646 --> 12:34.481
Yeah.

12:34.596 --> 12:35.596
To do what?

12:36.760 --> 12:38.021
To kill Xu Fengnian.

12:38.871 --> 12:40.441
He is still alive and kicking.

12:42.021 --> 12:43.022
He saved you.

12:43.046 --> 12:44.326
Are you still going to kill him?

12:50.971 --> 12:52.796
I'm grateful to him in my heart,

12:55.771 --> 12:57.880
but it doesn't conflict
with killing him.

12:59.596 --> 13:01.961
It's hard to get both you want.

13:08.421 --> 13:09.601
There is no need to go.

13:12.321 --> 13:13.321
Grand Master!

13:19.221 --> 13:22.021
(Wudi City)

13:27.096 --> 13:28.196
Wang Xianzhi!

13:28.671 --> 13:29.721
Are you sleeping?

13:30.271 --> 13:31.280
Let's have a chat!

13:33.846 --> 13:35.561
Is that gonna get him to show up?

13:54.696 --> 13:55.696
What's the matter?

13:57.546 --> 13:59.046
He wants to see you!

14:02.196 --> 14:04.680
The 12 Flying Swords of Deng Tai'e?

14:04.746 --> 14:06.121
He gave it to him.

14:06.221 --> 14:07.671
You are lucky.

14:10.371 --> 14:11.571
Nice to meet you, Senior Wang.

14:11.621 --> 14:12.780
I'm Xu Fengnian.

14:13.221 --> 14:15.280
I need to ask for one favor from you.

14:15.746 --> 14:16.746
No.

14:16.946 --> 14:17.777
Two favors.

14:17.801 --> 14:18.972
I need to ask for two favors from you.

14:18.996 --> 14:20.246
Favors?

14:21.021 --> 14:21.760
Go ahead.

14:21.821 --> 14:23.146
The first thing

14:23.546 --> 14:25.721
is that I want to borrow
a good carriage from you.

14:26.021 --> 14:27.021
To be frank with you,

14:27.196 --> 14:28.221
I'm injured.

14:28.321 --> 14:29.941
I don't want to go back by water.

14:31.596 --> 14:34.046
You killed six martial slaves
in Wudi City,

14:34.321 --> 14:37.046
and you took the relic of Jian Jiuhuang.

14:38.121 --> 14:40.496
Now you are asking me for a carriage?

14:40.746 --> 14:42.561
I didn't kill those six men.

14:42.646 --> 14:43.885
I'm not capable of doing that.

14:44.196 --> 14:45.697
As for Old Huang's relic,

14:45.721 --> 14:47.361
I will give you an account.

14:47.771 --> 14:49.171
How?

14:59.471 --> 15:01.171
Old Huang and Sword God Li

15:01.446 --> 15:02.996
are my elders!

15:03.721 --> 15:05.496
I will take over

15:05.896 --> 15:07.571
what they left undone!

15:12.296 --> 15:13.936
Dying in a battle
is the fate of Old Huang

15:14.321 --> 15:16.871
as a martial artist. He had no regrets.

15:17.346 --> 15:18.396
I never

15:19.021 --> 15:20.471
blamed you for that.

15:20.771 --> 15:22.696
As for Senior Li's battle today...

15:22.971 --> 15:24.021
I also lost.

15:24.396 --> 15:26.577
The battle is not won yet.

15:26.601 --> 15:27.601
Okay!

15:27.921 --> 15:29.201
It's not won yet.

15:29.621 --> 15:30.921
One defeat and one draw.

15:31.446 --> 15:32.721
They both didn't win you.

15:33.396 --> 15:34.396
Senior Wang,

15:35.296 --> 15:37.096
give me some time!

15:37.621 --> 15:40.136
I, Xu Fengnian, hereby swear to heaven

15:40.160 --> 15:42.896
that I will return to Wudi City one day

15:43.146 --> 15:44.426
and have a final battle with you

15:44.571 --> 15:46.081
above the East Sea

15:46.371 --> 15:48.361
for the sake of Sword God Li

15:48.421 --> 15:49.946
and Old Huang!

16:00.421 --> 16:01.961
Are you challenging me?

16:02.171 --> 16:03.171
Yes!

16:04.121 --> 16:05.361
Not only to challenge you,

16:05.946 --> 16:07.246
I will beat you!

16:10.596 --> 16:12.760
Young people now are bold indeed.

16:14.896 --> 16:15.896
All right.

16:16.496 --> 16:17.821
I'm gonna be crazy today, too.

16:19.221 --> 16:21.721
I've never won you in my life.

16:22.246 --> 16:23.246
Wang Xianzhi.

16:23.521 --> 16:24.996
I'll give my last chance

16:25.171 --> 16:26.921
to this boy.

16:30.246 --> 16:31.481
Do you trust him?

16:32.746 --> 16:34.646
What's good about the way of swords?

16:34.896 --> 16:36.346
The good thing

16:36.721 --> 16:37.971
is that it can be passed on!

16:41.646 --> 16:43.057
Among the young people today,

16:43.081 --> 16:44.976
you are the first one

16:45.000 --> 16:46.480
who dares to challenge me in my face.

16:46.971 --> 16:47.971
I'm afraid

16:48.896 --> 16:50.546
you will also be the last one.

16:51.846 --> 16:52.846
All right.

16:54.046 --> 16:55.271
I'll wait for you.

16:59.646 --> 17:00.880
Thank you, Senior Wang!

17:01.571 --> 17:03.221
When I return to Wudi City,

17:03.671 --> 17:05.321
I'll give the carriage back to you.

17:06.121 --> 17:07.971
I'll have someone send you the carriage.

17:10.596 --> 17:11.871
The second thing

17:15.696 --> 17:17.071
is that I heard from someone

17:18.871 --> 17:20.920
that you were also in the capital

17:22.646 --> 17:24.046
when my mother was attacked.

17:24.421 --> 17:26.501
You've been looking for
the one who killed my mother?

17:27.046 --> 17:28.240
Since Lady died,

17:29.171 --> 17:30.397
I've been looking into it.

17:30.421 --> 17:31.981
Everything I found out about the killer

17:32.071 --> 17:35.321
over these years
has been recorded in it.

17:43.546 --> 17:44.946
I was in the capital

17:45.471 --> 17:46.771
at that time.

17:47.596 --> 17:50.200
It was recorded in a booklet

17:50.646 --> 17:51.947
of my family
who have been investigating it.

17:51.971 --> 17:54.096
But no one has ever seen you
as a suspect.

17:54.346 --> 17:55.746
Because we all know

17:56.046 --> 17:57.801
that if it was you who did it,

17:57.946 --> 18:00.106
my mother would never
make it out of the capital alive.

18:00.246 --> 18:02.896
My presence in the capital
had nothing to do with her.

18:02.920 --> 18:04.122
I just want to ask you

18:04.146 --> 18:06.171
who besieged and killed my mother.

18:08.021 --> 18:10.001
I saw a few people

18:10.041 --> 18:12.400
who weren't supposed to be
in the capital,

18:13.046 --> 18:14.296
but I didn't see them

18:14.596 --> 18:16.196
during the battle.

18:23.396 --> 18:25.746
Was this person in the capital that day?

18:38.296 --> 18:39.321
(Han Diaosi) Yes.

18:52.721 --> 18:53.721
Thank you, Senior Wang.

18:56.946 --> 18:58.096
Who else was there

18:58.946 --> 19:00.046
besides him?

19:00.721 --> 19:02.496
I don't remember the names.

19:02.821 --> 19:04.160
I only remember

19:04.421 --> 19:07.440
I saw some people from North Mang
in the capital.

19:10.771 --> 19:11.880
People from North Mang?

19:12.821 --> 19:13.821
Martial artists?

19:14.021 --> 19:15.021
I guess.

19:15.421 --> 19:16.546
For me,

19:16.996 --> 19:17.996
they were all the same.

19:18.396 --> 19:19.821
The royal family of Liyang

19:21.021 --> 19:22.696
joined hands with their enemy

19:23.471 --> 19:25.761
to ambush their own official.

19:26.171 --> 19:27.496
How absurd.

19:27.696 --> 19:28.961
Take it easy.

19:29.421 --> 19:30.547
Thank you, Senior Wang.

19:30.571 --> 19:31.761
What are you going to do?

19:32.071 --> 19:33.911
I think it's time for me
to get on another trip

19:34.096 --> 19:35.950
after I get home.

19:39.696 --> 19:41.272
Are you going to North Mang?

19:41.296 --> 19:42.296
Yes.

19:44.196 --> 19:45.971
Don't forget our engagement.

19:46.296 --> 19:47.296
Rest assured.

19:47.996 --> 19:49.761
I won't die in North Mang.

19:51.546 --> 19:52.546
Senior Wang!

19:53.446 --> 19:54.446
There is one last thing.

19:54.721 --> 19:56.361
That's the third thing you're asking.

19:58.671 --> 20:00.346
What did Old Huang say before he died?

20:23.221 --> 20:24.221
Come on.

20:26.546 --> 20:27.880
Bring wine

20:30.096 --> 20:31.746
to His Highness.

20:50.521 --> 20:51.761
Which way was he looking?

21:01.221 --> 21:02.221
North.

21:14.171 --> 21:14.817
Your Highness.

21:14.841 --> 21:15.657
Wait for me.

21:15.681 --> 21:18.321
I'll bring you the wine of the East Sea
and we will drink together.

21:18.396 --> 21:19.396
Okay.

21:22.801 --> 21:23.821
You filled the cup!

21:34.746 --> 21:35.946
Qingniao, get in the carriage.

21:35.996 --> 21:36.996
Senior, you too.

21:39.246 --> 21:41.146
(Wudi City)

21:44.521 --> 21:45.522
Your Highness, you leave first.

21:45.546 --> 21:47.142
I'll get Fengzi Battalion's brothers

21:47.166 --> 21:48.346
and catch up with you soon.

21:48.546 --> 21:49.457
Shu Xiu, you go with him.

21:49.481 --> 21:51.257
Tell the boatman to go back
down the river

21:51.281 --> 21:52.441
and send them to North Liang.

21:54.571 --> 21:55.571
Yes.

21:56.396 --> 21:57.396
Let's go.

22:05.371 --> 22:11.996
(Wudi City)

22:31.396 --> 22:32.396
Go.

22:34.071 --> 22:35.071
(Wudi City)

22:46.871 --> 22:47.996
Go to West Shu?

22:48.421 --> 22:50.456
Cao Changqing
and the Princess of West Chu

22:50.480 --> 22:51.796
have arrived in Shu.

22:52.296 --> 22:54.521
The survivors of Chu
are ready to take action.

22:54.561 --> 22:57.596
The court believes
that there will be turmoil in Shu.

22:58.046 --> 22:59.046
This is a chance.

22:59.271 --> 23:00.271
Exactly.

23:00.446 --> 23:03.421
The court needs someone
to go to Shu and put down the riot.

23:07.021 --> 23:07.977
Could it be me?

23:08.001 --> 23:09.001
Who else could it be?

23:09.296 --> 23:10.296
But,

23:10.646 --> 23:12.281
it's not supposed to be me.

23:13.721 --> 23:15.096
Xu Xiao can't go there.

23:15.841 --> 23:17.346
If North Liang takes over West Shu,

23:17.771 --> 23:19.571
the whole world will be surnamed Xu.

23:21.821 --> 23:22.821
What about Gu Jiantang?

23:23.596 --> 23:24.946
Gu Jiantang called in sick.

23:26.021 --> 23:27.136
His Majesty dares not

23:27.160 --> 23:29.040
set free a tiger like him
back to the mountains.

23:30.821 --> 23:31.821
That's right.

23:32.746 --> 23:34.247
The person who commands the army
in West Shu

23:34.271 --> 23:36.796
must be trusted by His Majesty.

23:39.621 --> 23:40.621
Grand Master.

23:41.146 --> 23:42.146
But,

23:42.546 --> 23:44.755
there are also other princes.

23:45.196 --> 23:46.196
I...

23:48.121 --> 23:49.146
Who are willing

23:50.096 --> 23:53.396
to risk their lives
and fight against Cao Changqing?

23:54.421 --> 23:55.737
They are either hesitant

23:55.761 --> 23:56.846
or scared.

23:56.971 --> 23:59.001
This is the chance of a lifetime.

23:59.546 --> 24:00.696
I got the mission

24:00.720 --> 24:03.400
of quelling the unrest in West Shu

24:03.696 --> 24:05.121
for you.

24:05.546 --> 24:06.546
This is

24:06.921 --> 24:08.371
His Majesty's imperial secret edict.

24:33.746 --> 24:35.480
But Cao Changqing
is difficult to deal with.

24:36.546 --> 24:38.096
I'll go to the west with you.

24:39.571 --> 24:40.746
More importantly,

24:41.021 --> 24:43.546
you don't have to make an enemy
of Cao Changqing.

24:44.371 --> 24:45.371
Let me ask you.

24:46.196 --> 24:47.920
What's the ultimate goal
of the Chu people?

24:48.221 --> 24:49.221
To go back home?

24:49.271 --> 24:50.271
That's right.

24:50.996 --> 24:53.621
Hiding in Shu
is only a temporary measure.

24:55.160 --> 24:57.376
After Cao Changqing
and the Princess of West Chu

24:57.400 --> 24:58.936
gather those veterans together...

24:58.960 --> 25:00.297
They will leave West Shu

25:00.321 --> 25:01.337
and go back to Chu.

25:01.361 --> 25:02.537
By that time,

25:02.561 --> 25:04.871
there will be no one in West Shu
who can hold you back.

25:05.171 --> 25:06.801
You are the rightful commander

25:06.841 --> 25:08.121
of the military.

25:08.371 --> 25:09.371
At that time,

25:10.271 --> 25:12.396
you will be the new Lord of West Shu.

25:14.796 --> 25:16.721
I'm afraid that His Majesty
would issue an order

25:17.546 --> 25:18.986
and take back my power at that time.

25:20.721 --> 25:23.246
Will you take such an order?

25:28.621 --> 25:29.746
Of course not.

25:31.096 --> 25:32.297
After I take control of Shu,

25:32.321 --> 25:34.321
the next step
is to reach beyond the border.

25:38.521 --> 25:39.746
Beyond the border,

25:39.921 --> 25:40.921
the wildness area?

25:42.921 --> 25:45.171
After the wilderness
and West Shu are stitched together,

25:46.021 --> 25:48.422
it will provide me with the groundwork
for taking control of the Central Plains.

25:48.446 --> 25:49.246
I'll become an unshakable Lord of Shu

25:49.346 --> 25:51.646
in the worst situation.

25:52.071 --> 25:53.571
You are able to foresee that.

25:54.521 --> 25:57.471
My teachings over these years
have not been wasted.

25:57.846 --> 25:59.121
Grand Master, thank you

25:59.721 --> 26:01.521
for seizing such a good chance for me.

26:01.771 --> 26:02.801
Say no more.

26:03.071 --> 26:05.171
Let's set off for West Shu immediately.

26:10.121 --> 26:11.646
Who is this guy?

26:16.146 --> 26:17.221
Yuan Tingshan.

26:17.571 --> 26:18.922
He used to be a retainer
of the Xuanyuan Family.

26:18.946 --> 26:19.857
Now he is driven desperate

26:19.881 --> 26:22.171
and he can be used.

26:23.171 --> 26:25.057
I'm willing to be a blade
for the Lord of Shu

26:25.081 --> 26:26.196
to kill all the enemies.

26:37.571 --> 26:40.396
This world has
finally given me a chance.

26:40.721 --> 26:42.960
A chance

26:45.096 --> 26:46.240
to make a great coup.

26:54.571 --> 26:56.071
We're finally going back.

26:57.946 --> 26:58.621
Eh.

26:58.721 --> 26:59.721
Kid.

27:00.071 --> 27:02.311
Let me see the flying swords
of Deng Tai'e one more time.

27:03.296 --> 27:04.921
Qingniao, open it for me.

27:16.371 --> 27:18.121
Do you also know this sword array?

27:19.471 --> 27:21.821
In the beginning,
there are thousands of ways of swords,

27:21.996 --> 27:24.671
but all the ways seem to lead
to the same destination.

27:24.946 --> 27:26.221
But it's just an illusion.

27:26.471 --> 27:27.471
Kid.

27:27.521 --> 27:29.160
No ways lead to the same destination.

27:29.446 --> 27:30.616
The flying swords of Deng Tai'e

27:30.640 --> 27:31.616
and my sword

27:31.640 --> 27:32.377
look similar,

27:32.401 --> 27:33.822
but they are totally different.

27:33.846 --> 27:35.216
It's hard to explain to you.

27:35.240 --> 27:36.322
The more I say,
the harder for you to understand.

27:36.346 --> 27:37.696
Figure it out yourself.

27:41.021 --> 27:42.146
Excellent.

27:42.221 --> 27:43.221
You deserve a reward.

28:33.296 --> 28:34.456
The Fengzi Battalion is back.

28:38.496 --> 28:39.521
Let's go home!

29:19.146 --> 29:20.046
Grand Master.

29:20.121 --> 29:21.977
Why are we taking so many turns
along the way?

29:22.001 --> 29:23.422
In case someone should block our way.

29:23.446 --> 29:24.596
Will anyone block my way?

29:25.046 --> 29:26.671
We must be careful all the time.

29:27.871 --> 29:29.471
Why don't we speed up the horses?

29:29.521 --> 29:31.896
The horses also need to rest.

29:31.920 --> 29:33.960
Don't wear the horses out
in the middle of the road.

29:34.846 --> 29:35.880
Grand Master.

29:36.271 --> 29:38.281
Wang Xianzhi and Li Chungang

29:38.396 --> 29:40.071
could fly to the sky.

29:41.596 --> 29:43.246
They used their genuine spirit.

29:44.796 --> 29:45.796
Can you do it?

29:47.196 --> 29:48.196
You tell me.

29:51.646 --> 29:53.746
Xu Fengnian is also on his way home.

29:54.621 --> 29:55.821
Do you even know that?

29:56.096 --> 29:57.997
I have someone keep an eye on him
from a distance.

29:58.021 --> 29:59.572
When we were resting along the way,

29:59.596 --> 30:02.801
there were spies reporting
Xu Fengnian's whereabouts.

30:04.021 --> 30:05.746
Is there a need to keep an eye on him?

30:07.896 --> 30:09.671
If I can become the Lord of Shu,

30:11.021 --> 30:12.396
I won't have to kill him.

30:13.146 --> 30:13.937
Actually...

30:13.961 --> 30:15.161
I've been thinking all the way

30:15.471 --> 30:17.136
that you said

30:17.160 --> 30:18.697
Xu Fengnian saved your life
in Wudi City.

30:18.721 --> 30:20.621
It doesn't make sense.

30:21.071 --> 30:22.797
Could it be that Xu Fengnian knew

30:22.821 --> 30:24.597
we are going to command the military
in West Shu?

30:24.621 --> 30:26.696
How could he know the secret edict?

30:27.371 --> 30:28.771
Even if he knew,

30:28.896 --> 30:30.347
why did he save Zhao Kai?

30:30.371 --> 30:32.672
West Shu and North Liang
can join hands to become more powerful.

30:32.696 --> 30:34.596
Xu Fengnian
is the next Lord of North Liang.

30:34.846 --> 30:36.472
If he makes an alliance
with the Lord of Shu,

30:36.496 --> 30:38.246
he can rest assured without anxiety.

30:40.246 --> 30:42.561
There is some truth in that.

30:42.846 --> 30:43.966
It still doesn't make sense.

30:44.871 --> 30:46.872
Xu Fengnian was thousands of miles away
from the court.

30:46.896 --> 30:48.536
How could he know
what the court would do?

30:48.746 --> 30:49.821
Furthermore,

30:50.196 --> 30:51.361
when we were in Wudi City,

30:51.771 --> 30:53.046
Grand Master hadn't come yet.

30:53.496 --> 30:55.521
I didn't even know
that I would go to West Shu.

30:55.846 --> 30:57.147
Anyway,

30:57.171 --> 30:59.136
Xu Fengnian had no reason to save you.

30:59.160 --> 31:00.960
There is something odd about it.

31:01.821 --> 31:03.021
So I had

31:03.171 --> 31:05.921
spies keep an eye on him along the way.

31:08.196 --> 31:09.797
Where did you get so many spies?

31:09.821 --> 31:11.246
After all these years,

31:11.321 --> 31:13.797
I should build some forces for myself.

31:13.821 --> 31:16.546
It will all be yours one day.

31:17.696 --> 31:18.696
Grand Master.

31:19.696 --> 31:20.921
If it weren't for you,

31:22.471 --> 31:23.960
I wouldn't be here today.

31:24.971 --> 31:26.257
If it weren't for your mother,

31:26.281 --> 31:27.622
I wouldn't be here today, either.

31:27.646 --> 31:29.041
All right, enough with this.

31:29.221 --> 31:30.847
The spies reported

31:30.871 --> 31:33.646
that Xu Fengnian and his entourage
are heading for North Liang.

31:33.871 --> 31:34.801
Based on the distance,

31:34.871 --> 31:36.550
even they want to block us,

31:36.896 --> 31:37.896
they can't.

31:38.446 --> 31:39.572
That's foolproof then.

31:39.596 --> 31:40.737
During these days,

31:40.761 --> 31:43.281
Xu Fengnian has been in the carriage
and never showed up.

31:44.021 --> 31:45.146
Is he injured?

31:45.296 --> 31:46.296
I don't know.

31:46.746 --> 31:47.946
Your spies

31:48.321 --> 31:49.946
can't block and search them, right?

31:53.621 --> 31:55.121
Xu Fengnian and his entourage

31:55.846 --> 31:57.621
are almost past Guangling.

32:25.171 --> 32:26.171
What's that?

32:29.896 --> 32:32.761
I sent a message to Zhao Yi,
Lord of Guangling.

32:32.896 --> 32:34.046
Zhao Yi?

32:34.796 --> 32:35.936
That guy

32:35.960 --> 32:37.646
is notorious among the vassals.

32:37.771 --> 32:39.261
What message did you send to him?

32:39.285 --> 32:40.400
Nothing important.

32:40.721 --> 32:41.771
I mentioned two things.

32:42.221 --> 32:43.221
One is

32:43.771 --> 32:45.896
that the court is not happy

32:45.920 --> 32:47.746
about Xu Fengnian leaving Wudi City

32:48.046 --> 32:49.296
successfully.

32:49.846 --> 32:50.721
What's the other thing?

32:50.796 --> 32:53.196
Xu Fengnian
is accompanied by a beauty.

32:54.121 --> 32:56.546
Zhao Yi and his son are lascivious.

32:58.146 --> 32:59.221
Do you want to

32:59.996 --> 33:01.200
use Zhao Yi's

33:01.546 --> 33:02.298
Guangling Army

33:02.322 --> 33:03.337
to test Xu Fengnian?

33:03.361 --> 33:04.400
Although that guy

33:05.146 --> 33:06.646
is notorious,

33:06.771 --> 33:07.886
he is no fool.

33:08.321 --> 33:09.747
Would he dare to harm Xu Fengnian?

33:09.771 --> 33:11.121
Why would he harm Xu Fengnian?

33:11.571 --> 33:13.577
Just scare Xu Fengnian with the army

33:13.601 --> 33:15.361
to make the court look good

33:15.746 --> 33:18.136
and then take the girl away.

33:18.160 --> 33:19.196
It's just a girl.

33:19.521 --> 33:21.171
What can North Liang say?

33:21.271 --> 33:22.396
Xu Fengnian

33:23.996 --> 33:25.696
won't give her away.

33:26.046 --> 33:28.646
Zhao Yi doesn't know
what kind of person Xu Fengnian is.

33:29.771 --> 33:31.321
With the way he handles things,

33:31.471 --> 33:32.596
a girl

33:33.896 --> 33:35.421
is not as important as an object.

34:19.096 --> 34:20.096
Senior Li.

34:47.471 --> 34:48.871
It's Zhao Yi's Guangling Army.

35:04.971 --> 35:05.971
Senior Li.

35:06.096 --> 35:08.016
It looks like there are
over a thousand soldiers.

35:24.671 --> 35:26.421
I finally got a good sleep.

35:27.521 --> 35:28.521
It's so troublesome.

37:04.321 --> 37:12.321
(Tingchao Pavilion)

37:41.946 --> 37:43.647
(Tablet of Zhao Changling
Tablet of Chen Qiong)

37:43.671 --> 37:45.021
(Tablet of Wang Jian)

38:17.046 --> 38:18.396
People all think

38:18.671 --> 38:20.176
(Tablet of Shao Jingui)
that you will trap yourself

38:20.200 --> 38:22.720
(Tablet of Dong Dashun)
on the top of Tingchao Pavilion forever.

38:23.296 --> 38:24.961
Today is the Memorial Day
of my brothers.

38:25.796 --> 38:26.921
How can I not come?

38:29.296 --> 38:30.296
Besides,

38:31.146 --> 38:32.760
my prison is Tingchao Pavilion.

38:33.571 --> 38:34.622
My activities

38:34.646 --> 38:36.800
are restricted to Tingchao Pavilion.

38:37.271 --> 38:38.216
Whether it's on the top

38:38.240 --> 38:39.240
or beneath the ground,

38:39.371 --> 38:40.496
I'm still

38:40.846 --> 38:42.401
inside Tingchao Pavilion.

38:42.746 --> 38:43.946
I've never crossed the border.

38:48.871 --> 38:49.921
Well,

38:52.221 --> 38:54.441
we do this every year.

38:56.196 --> 38:57.561
There are fewer and fewer people

38:58.396 --> 38:59.601
around us

39:00.846 --> 39:01.846
but more and more

39:02.721 --> 39:04.200
spirit tablets.

39:07.921 --> 39:09.200
Finally,

39:09.471 --> 39:12.771
we've gained world peace.

39:14.796 --> 39:15.796
But they

39:17.246 --> 39:18.481
can't see it.

39:20.446 --> 39:21.721
They are seeing it now.

39:22.996 --> 39:24.671
They've been seeing it.

39:28.146 --> 39:31.921
Li Chungang defeated more than 2,000 soldiers
with one slash of his sword.

39:32.521 --> 39:35.896
The Guangling Army is terrified.

39:37.346 --> 39:38.946
Do you hear it?

39:41.096 --> 39:42.421
Do you hear it?

39:42.846 --> 39:43.921
It's the one,

39:44.221 --> 39:46.577
the Sword God Li

39:46.601 --> 39:47.337
who had been with you

39:47.361 --> 39:48.561
for years.

39:49.021 --> 39:50.021
He showed

39:50.121 --> 39:51.196
his power this time.

39:52.646 --> 39:53.840
Fengnian

39:54.471 --> 39:55.796
didn't show up.

39:58.221 --> 39:59.321
You know what,

40:00.646 --> 40:02.296
I've got everything prepared this time

40:02.921 --> 40:05.521
for his trip to the martial world.

40:06.396 --> 40:09.401
Let it be Qingzhou

40:09.441 --> 40:10.720
or Jiangnan,

40:10.971 --> 40:12.256
my plan

40:12.280 --> 40:14.881
is basically seamless.

40:17.596 --> 40:18.800
Chen Zhibao

40:19.571 --> 40:22.081
never showed up in the camp.

40:22.671 --> 40:23.578
No one

40:23.602 --> 40:25.446
knows his whereabouts.

40:31.896 --> 40:33.396
I can't believe

40:34.321 --> 40:36.071
Fengnian pulled off his plan

40:36.771 --> 40:38.996
when I got everything planned.

40:39.796 --> 40:41.396
He even fooled me!

40:43.721 --> 40:44.800
I didn't know

40:46.321 --> 40:47.396
what he was doing

40:48.421 --> 40:49.680
until the end.

40:52.996 --> 40:54.041
If he followed

40:54.896 --> 40:57.401
your plan all the time,

40:57.796 --> 40:59.021
he would become

40:59.121 --> 41:00.746
another Xu Xiao.

41:04.246 --> 41:05.246
Um.

41:12.971 --> 41:14.421
He chose

41:14.896 --> 41:16.246
a different path from mine.

41:17.921 --> 41:18.921
It's a path

41:19.496 --> 41:21.840
I never dared to set foot on.

41:24.646 --> 41:25.680
My son,

41:26.496 --> 41:27.760
Xu Fengnian,

41:29.196 --> 41:31.240
will break my chains on him

41:31.421 --> 41:34.441
and face the world in his own way!

41:35.871 --> 41:38.921
He is the next Lord of North Liang!

41:40.521 --> 41:43.121
He will keep the flag of North Liang
flying in the air

41:43.771 --> 41:44.796
and guard

41:45.421 --> 41:48.096
the world we built together!

41:49.296 --> 41:50.521
Are you satisfied

41:51.221 --> 41:52.996
with such a future

41:53.621 --> 41:55.196
and such a Lord of North Liang?

42:14.096 --> 42:15.446
Our time

42:16.671 --> 42:17.821
is finally coming to an end.

42:21.046 --> 42:22.240
North Liang

42:23.846 --> 42:26.896
has a new lord now.

42:37.771 --> 42:39.747
(Tablet of Wu Ke)

42:39.771 --> 42:41.747
(Tablet of Hao Ning)

42:41.771 --> 42:43.747
(Tablet of Han Li)

42:43.771 --> 42:45.747
(Tablet of Peng Wanli)

42:45.771 --> 42:47.747
(Tablet of Zhou Guochang)

42:47.771 --> 42:49.771
(Tablet of Zhang Hanfu)

43:29.871 --> 43:32.621
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.396 --> 43:37.196
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.121 --> 43:42.041
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.121 --> 43:46.921
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.221 --> 43:51.121
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.821 --> 43:55.641
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.646 --> 44:00.401
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.421 --> 44:05.346
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.846 --> 44:08.577
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.601 --> 44:09.841
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.621 --> 44:14.481
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.296 --> 44:18.022
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.046 --> 44:19.481
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.971 --> 44:23.846
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.271 --> 44:25.622
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.646 --> 44:28.481
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.896 --> 44:31.377
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.401 --> 44:33.801
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.096 --> 44:36.122
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.146 --> 44:38.322
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.346 --> 44:42.561
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.921 --> 44:44.057
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.081 --> 44:47.121
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.296 --> 44:49.257
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.281 --> 44:52.001
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.561 --> 44:54.377
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.401 --> 44:56.897
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.921 --> 45:01.021
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
